    dest="Moves into Chennai often end on OMR, in Velachery, Tambaram, Porur or Anna Nagar. The coastal humidity is hard on wooden furniture and electronics, so these get an extra wrap. From October to December the north-east monsoon brings heavy rain, so delivery days are planned around it. Gated communities on OMR and ECR usually want a move-in request with the crew names and allow unloading only in a fixed window, and some ECR villas sit on sandy lanes where a large truck cannot turn, so a smaller vehicle does the last stretch. Salt air near the sea at Besant Nagar, Thiruvanmiyur and along ECR is hard on metal and mirrors, so steel almirahs, mirrors and appliances are wrapped fully, not just at the corners. The truck comes into the city from the north on NH16, so an address in south Chennai adds a couple of hours on delivery day.",
