   ("Do I need a society NOC to shift in Mumbai?","Most Mumbai societies ask for an NOC or a move-in letter from the secretary, and some ask for a refundable deposit or a fixed lift slot. Get it from both the old and the new society before moving day, and we plan the loading time around what they allow."),
