    dest="Pune homes are more spread out, and most moves from Mumbai end in housing societies in Hinjewadi, Wakad, Baner, Balewadi, Kharadi or Hadapsar, or in Pimpri-Chinchwad. Societies here usually have bigger lifts and more parking than Mumbai buildings, so unloading is quicker, though many still want a move-in permission and a lift booking. In the old city around Sadashiv Peth and Kasba Peth the lanes are narrow, and a smaller vehicle handles the last few hundred metres.",
