  journey="The truck halts overnight near Gwalior or Jhansi and again near Nagpur, then runs down NH44 through Adilabad into Telangana. Much of the Nagpur to Hyderabad stretch is fast highway, so the last day of the trip is usually smooth. Toll charges on NH44 are shown as one line in the estimate.",
