  journey="This is a 3 to 4 day drive with overnight halts usually near Jhansi, Nagpur and Hyderabad or Kurnool. Because the trip is long, cartons are packed with extra layers at the corners and furniture is wrapped twice, and the truck is sealed in front of you at loading in Delhi.",
